        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-442-510"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-442-463"><rb>鶯</rb><rt>うぐひす</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-463-478"><rb>眠</rb><rt>ねむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-478-481">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-481-508"><rb>花楮</rb><rt>はなかうぞ</rt></ruby></p>
        <p source="#source-510-575"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510-525"><rb>月</rb><rt>つき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-525-528">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-528-546"><rb>翁</rb><rt>おきな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-546-549">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-549-564"><rb>面</rb><rt>めん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-564-575">のうへ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-575-622"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-575-593"><rb>皷</rb><rt>つづみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-593-622">うてうておもしろく</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-622-681"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622-637"><rb>春</rb><rt>はる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-637-652">はふたたび</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-652-679"><rb>花楮</rb><rt>はなかうぞ</rt></ruby></p>
